  <section class="hero grid-overlay">
    <div class="container hero-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Construction ka smart hisaab</div>
        <h1>Thekedaar Ka <span class="accent">Digital</span><br>Attendance, Hisaab<br>aur Full Control</h1>
        <p>
          Thekedaari ek modern thekedaar software hai jisme aap worker attendance, mazdoori, site kharcha,
          material purchase, udhaar aur project wise profit-loss ko ek hi dashboard me manage kar sakte ho.
          Diary aur register ki jagah ab construction ka complete control mobile aur desktop dono par pao.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Register Free</a>
