  <section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Thekedaar Software me kya kya milega?</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Construction business me sabse badi problem hoti hai scattered data. Alag diary me attendance,
        alag notebook me kharcha aur alag dimag me udhaar ya payment. Thekedaari in sab ko ek
        digital system me convert karta hai jisse aapko real-time control milta hai.
      </p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon-box">👷</div>
          <h3>Worker Attendance</h3>
          <p>Roz ki attendance, half-day, full-day, site-wise ya project-wise entry. Purani register system ko simple digital attendance me convert karo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon-box">💰</div>
          <h3>Labour Payment & Udhaar</h3>
          <p>Kis worker ko kitna dena hai, kitna advance diya, kitna balance bacha — sab kuch clear ledger ke saath.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon-box">📦</div>
          <h3>Material & Site Kharcha</h3>
          <p>Cement, steel, plumbing, transport, petty cash aur daily site expense ka smart हिसाब. Loss kaha ho raha hai, turant samajh aata hai.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel" style="margin-top:26px; text-align:left;">
        <h3>Why contractors choose Thekedaari?</h3>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Project wise expense tracking</li>
          <li>Labour attendance with payment linkage</li>
          <li>Daily hisaab without manual register</li>
          <li>Udhaar aur balance clear report</li>
          <li>Profit-loss visibility in one place</li>
          <li>Mobile friendly for on-site use</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="benefits">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Thekedaar ke liye real business benefit</h3>
        <p>
          Sirf data save karna kaafi nahi hota. Software tab useful hota hai jab wo aapko better decision lene me help kare.
          Thekedaari ke through aap samajh sakte ho ki kaunsi site me labour cost zyada ja rahi hai, kis project me material leak ho raha hai,
          kis worker ka payment pending hai aur current cash position kya hai.
        </p>
        <div class="badge-list">
          <span class="badge">Fast entries</span>
          <span class="badge">Clear reports</span>
          <span class="badge">No paper dependency</span>
          <span class="badge">Easy for site staff</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><strong>1 App</strong><span>All site records</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Daily</strong><span>Attendance updates</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Live</strong><span>Balance visibility</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Clear</strong><span>Profit-loss tracking</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Perfect for these users</h3>
        <p>
          Agar aap contractor, builder, thekedaar, site supervisor ya labour team manage karte ho,
          to ye software aapke daily operations ko simplify karta hai. Small contractors ke liye bhi easy hai aur growing teams ke liye bhi scalable hai.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Independent contractors</li>
          <li>House construction projects</li>
          <li>Civil work contractors</li>
          <li>Interior contractors</li>
          <li>Labour management teams</li>
          <li>Multi-site operators</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Kaise kaam karta hai?</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Simple setup, quick onboarding aur direct practical use. Team ko training dena bhi easy hai.</p>
      <div class="panel" style="text-align:left; margin-top:22px;">
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h4>Register karo aur project banao</h4><p>Account create karke apni company, site ya project setup karo.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h4>Workers aur daily entries add karo</h4><p>Attendance, payment, kharcha aur material entries start karo. Data ek jagah store hoga.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h4>Reports dekho aur control lo</h4><p>Balance, site expenses, due amount aur profit-loss ko dashboard se monitor karo.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <div>
            <h2>Thekedaar ho? Ab diary chhodo, digital ho jao.</h2>
            <p>Free setup ke saath Thekedaari try karo aur attendance, labour payment aur site hisaab ko smart tareeke se manage karo.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Start Free</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://thekedaari.com/login">Login</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

